e":["Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-mahimā"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["gaurāṅgera duṭi pada    yāra dhana sampada","    se jāne bhakati-rasa-sāra","gaurāṅgera madhura-līlā    yāra karṇe praveśilā","    hṛdaya nirmala bhela tāra"],"translation":["One whose wealth is Śrī Gaurāṅga’s feet knows the essence of devotion’s rasa. The heart of one who hears Śrī Gaurāṅga’s sweet Pastimes becomes pure."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["ye gaurāṅgera nāma laya    tāra haya premodaya","    tāre muñi yāi balihāri","gaurāṅga-guṇete jhure    nitya-līlā tāre sphure","    se jana bhakati-adhikārī"],"translation":["One who chants Śrī Gaurāṅga’s Name develops divine love. To him, I say, “Bravo!” The eternal Pastimes are revealed to one who cries over Śrī Gaurāṅga’s qualities. Such a soul is qualified for devotion."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["gaurāṅgera saṅgi-gaṇe    nitya-siddha kari māne","    se yāya vrajendra-suta-pāśa","śrī-gauḍa-maṇḍala-bhūmi    yebā jāne chintāmaṇi","    tāra haya vraja-bhūme vāsa"],"translation":["One who considers Śrī Gaurāṅga’s associates to be eternally liberated reaches Kṛṣṇa. One who knows the holy land of Gauḍa to be made of wish-fulfilling (spiritual) gemstone resides in the land of Vraja."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["gaura-prema-rasārṇave    se taraṅge yebā ḍube","    se rādhā-mādhava-antaraṅga","gṛhe vā vanete thāke    ‘hā gaurāṅga’ bale ḍāke","    narottama māge tāra saṅga"],"translation":["One who swims in the waves of the nectarean ocean of divine love for Śrī Gaura is an intimate associate of Śrī Śrī Rādhā-Mādhava. Whether he lives in a house or in the forest, Narottam Dās begs for the association of one who calls, ‘O Gaurāṅga!’"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/25-gaurangera-duti-pada-3","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/acharyamaharaj/5-savarana-sri-gaura-mahima","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gaurangera-duti-pada","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Bhakti Lalita Devi","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bhakti-lalita-devi/bhakti-lalita-devi-savarana-sri-gaura-mahima-gaurangera-duti-pada","personSlug":"bhakti-lalita-devi"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gaurangera-duti","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-mahimā-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/gaurangera-duti-pada-jar-dhana-sampada/","description":"Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-mahimā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-mahimā. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"gaurangera-duti-pada-jar-dhana-sampada"}}